export anchor ClubLEDStyle:
    number: 327
    screen: MusicPlayer
    name: Club LED
    idea: The screen is a wall of LED modules in a black housing, with the title spelled in round lit dots on a matrix, a strip of colour blocks that pulse to the beat and square light pads for every control.
    base: dark
    palette:
        housing: #060507, the page, the gaps between modules and the style sheet
        module: #121015, module faces and unlit pads, with a fine dot texture
        dotOff: #2a1226, unlit title dots, with unlit progress and volume dots in #241f2b
        edge: #2d2733, module borders and unlit pad rims
        ink: #f6eef6, text
        haze: #ad9fb0, labels and meta
        magenta: #ff5bd9, the title matrix, the liked pad, playlist counts and focus
        amber: #ffb22e, the clock matrix, the current lyric and the pause pad
        cyan: #3fe0ff, progress dots, the volume column, queue bullets and durations
        onColour: #140510, text on lit pads
    type:
        A monospace stack, ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, for all text.
        Base 14px at 1.5. The title and the clock are not type but a 5 by 7
        dot matrix drawn in SVG with a 10px pitch. The current lyric is
        clamp 18 to 26px at 700 in caps with 0.08em tracking, queue titles
        15px at 700 in caps, and labels 12px in caps with 0.2em tracking.
    layout:
        A twelve column wall of modules with 4px black gaps. Module 01
        spans eight columns with Brightwork Sound and a magenta On air lamp,
        then HARBOUR over LIGHTS in magenta dots with every unlit dot still
        visible, then the artist and the album in caps. Module 02, the
        Clock, spells 2 14 in amber dots over of 4 38 and a row of 40 cyan
        dots lit to just under half. A full width strip of twelve colour
        blocks in magenta, amber and cyan pulses gently. The Pads module is
        a three by two grid of square pads, SHUFFLE OFF, PREV, an amber
        lit PAUSE PLAYING, NEXT, REPEAT OFF and a magenta lit LIKED ON. A
        narrow Level module holds a column of ten round cyan dots with
        seven lit from the bottom and 70%. Up next lists the five songs
        with a ringed cyan bullet, caps titles and cyan times on dashed
        rules. Lyrics shows the current line in glowing amber caps on a
        dotted band behind a play arrow, with Next line and the second line
        in small caps beneath. Crates lists the playlists with magenta
        counts and caps chips for Albums, Artists and Podcasts. Below
        1000px every module takes a full row and the level column turns
        sideways. Below 560px the pulse strip shows six blocks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 4px black gaps between modules, 16px inside a module and 8px between pads.
    density: Medium high. Many small modules, each with one job.
    corners: 4px modules and pads, perfect circles for every LED dot.
    borders: 1px edge around every module and 2px rims on pads, coloured when a pad is lit.
    shadows: Only light. Lit pads and dots glow with 16px of their own colour at 45 percent. No drop shadows.
    icons:
        Solid glyphs above a caps word on each pad. State is written on the
        pad, OFF, PLAYING or ON, and the liked pad adds a filled heart. The
        current lyric gets a play arrow.
    focus: A 2px magenta outline offset 3px with a matching magenta glow.
    tone: Club caps, such as ON AIR, PADS, LEVEL, UP NEXT and CRATES.
